WEBVTT

00:04:28.931 --> 00:04:30.434
that you have stolen.

00:04:30.434 --> 00:04:32.751
I show you how you stole it

00:04:32.751 --> 00:04:34.471
and when, or what you used

00:04:34.471 --> 00:04:36.739
what you had stolen to do.

00:04:36.739 --> 00:04:41.309
What is the essence of journalism if it doesn't benefit society?

00:04:41.309 --> 00:04:43.753
My kind of journalism is a product

00:04:43.753 --> 00:04:47.170
of my society.

00:04:47.170 --> 00:04:50.348
I know that sometimes

00:04:50.348 --> 00:04:54.020
people have their own criticisms

00:04:54.020 --> 00:04:57.508
about undercover journalism.

00:04:57.508 --> 00:05:01.686
(Video) Official: He brought out some money from his pockets